.\" crates/robodr-depot/src/cli.rs, the crate docs and
.\" docs/SECURE-DELIVERY.md (sections 4-6, 8 and 10). Keep them in sync.
.TH ROBODR\-DEPOT 8 "2026-10-30" "RoboDR 0.1.0-alpha.1" "RoboDR Manual"
.SH NAME
robodr\-depot \- the site depot of RoboDR's secure delivery: import, enrolment, staged rollouts, mutual-TLS serving, leases
